  "scope": "Replace two private rank-forcing order wrappers with existing lemmas",
  "validation": "Paired target and its sole tracked direct Lean client ArithmeticRankForcing2011 pass with identical client objects. Nine retained target declaration type/axiom reports and 28,971 global simp and 13,167 instance entries match. The two removed private wrapper declarations are unregistered.",
  "limitations": [
    "The first provisional client failed because the temporary overlay nested its provider directory and omitted ArithmeticMaskPopulation; failure receipts and logs survive, but output paths were subsequently reused.",
    "Direct provider source/object pairs match prior receipts; transitive project/package closure is cached and not fully rebuilt. Post-build client LEAN_PATH samples resolve the old ArithmeticWindowDigits object a2fc28bd… from before 3e1cc2606b, along with older PellRecurrence, BinomLegendre and HalfBinomial objects; transitive objects were not hash-pinned at build time.",
    "Tracked Lean/Python source search found no references to the deleted qualified private suffixes; other types, untracked files, dynamic names, downstream environments and all environment extensions were not exhaustively searched.",
    "One paired timing sample ran under shared load. Compiled objects are excluded; input/object hash observations and commands are retained."
  ],
